# The Syringe Gun's needles in the shooter's own first person (real TF2;
# ours: needles_fp.scene): where a needle first shows against the view
# model's muzzle flash. This account's Medic carries the Crusader's
# Crossbow, so the stock gun (17) is swapped in for the scene (`stock`).
# From 2fort's bridge (0 -300 0) looking 10 degrees down along it, one
# tapped shot, every frame at 60 a second for 0.5 s (`needle_NN`).
#   tools/tf2ref/tf2ref.py scene tools/tf2ref/scenes/needles_fp.tf2 --out <dir>
mp_disable_respawn_times 1
cl_drawhud 0
r_drawvgui 0
r_drawviewmodel 1
fov_desired 90
viewmodel_fov 54
fps_max 60
mat_colorcorrection 0
tf_weapon_criticals 0
host_framerate 0
bot_kick all
sleep 1
jointeam red
sleep 1
joinclass medic
kill
sleep 7
stock tf_weapon_syringegun_medic 17
sleep 2
setpos 0 -300 0
setang 10 90 0
sleep 3
shot needle_idle
host_framerate 0.016667
movie needle
wait 2
+attack
wait 2
-attack
wait 60
endmovie
host_framerate 0
sleep 1
